# Cloudflare Workers Assets response headers.
#
# Serve the raw markdown guides as UTF-8. Without an explicit charset the browser's
# built-in text viewer falls back to a legacy encoding (Windows-1252) and renders clean
# UTF-8 punctuation as mojibake (em-dash — shows as "â€""). The guides are also written in
# pure ASCII as a belt-and-suspenders guarantee, but declaring the charset is the correct
# server-side fix and covers any future non-ASCII content.
/guides/*
  Content-Type: text/markdown; charset=utf-8
